  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 1.18.2 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* 🧪 test: report coverage against src paths by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2147\n* 🧪 test: give macOS CI the longer test time limit by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2148\n* Accept absolute file URLs for local package installs by @srijan2607 in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2150\n* 🐛 fix(install): restore the spinner as default output by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2152\n* 🐛 fix(fanout): stop on an interrupt the interpreter dropped by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2154\n* 🐛 fix(install): print installer errors once in verbose by @gaborbernat in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2153\n\n## New Contributors\n* @srijan2607 made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2150\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.1...1.18.2",
